= The Revomatics =

'''Years active''': 2009 - Present <<BR>>
'''Location''': Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA

== Biography ==

The Revomatics are an instrumental surf rock band from Milwaukee, Wisconsin. Their sound and look is a throwback to early 60's surf bands. The group consists of veteran musicians who have all been active in Milwaukee's local music scene since the 1980's.

== Band Members ==

 * Drew de Lutio, lead guitar
 * Dave Thornton, rhythm guitar
 * Pete Flessas, bass guitar
 * Jeff Schneider, drums
 * Jim Vailliencourt, lead guitar (2009-2012)
 * Scott Barrette, lead guitar (2009-2012)


